of the original 31 episodes of jazz casual produced 28 still survive having been locked

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:43.940
away in a vault since their first and only broadcast some three decades ago now digitally

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:52.280
remastered these rare treasures capture the pure essence of the jazz experience by bringing together

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:57.420
these glimpses of the great creative artists from the earliest right down to the most modern jazz

